===Format===
* '''Group Stage:'''
** Four single round-robin format groups
*** Each group has five teams
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo1}}
** The top four teams from each group advance to the Playoffs:
*** Group stage winners advance to the '''Semifinals'''
*** Group stage runners-up advance to the '''Quarterfinals'''
*** Group stage 3<sup>rd</sup> & 4<sup>th</sup> placed teams advance to '''Round 1'''

* '''Playoffs:'''
** Single-Elimination bracket
** All matches ''(excl. Grand Final)'' are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** Grand Final is {{Abbr/Bo5}}
** Semifinals and Grand Final are played Offline in Bucharest

